            <note corresp="#d340-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d340-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State,S/S–NSC Files: Lot 63 D 351,NSC 5428 Memos (Nov.–Dec. 1955). Top Secret.Lay sent copies of this memorandum and its
                    enclosure to the Secretary of the Treasury, the Attorney General, the Special
                    Assistant to the President on Disarmament, the Director of the Bureau of the
                    Budget, the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff, the Chairman of the Atomic
                    Energy Commission, and the Director of Central Intelligence.</p>
            </note>
